F calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 51% of normal in November to December and 64% in September to October. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 58% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 15178 had its driest year in 1954 at 53% of normal.</p>"}
